# Plan Mode Enhancement

**Trigger**: User requests plan mode, says "plan" or "design", or asks "how to implement"

## CRITICAL: Plan Validation Gate

> Plan execution patterns are in `plan-execution.mdc`. This file covers plan creation only.

### Validation Checklist (Run Before Finalizing Plan)

| # | Criterion | Pass/Fail | Action if Fail |
|---|-----------|-----------|----------------|
| 0 | **Software 3.0 check**: Can this be achieved by composing existing LLM/agent capabilities (new LangGraph node, existing tool, prompt adjustment) instead of writing new code? | Must Pass | Document why code is necessary; propose prompt/agent-first alternative |
| 1 | Has "## Research Summary" section? | Must Pass | Run web research, add section |
| 2 | Research Summary has 2+ cited sources? | Must Pass | Add more sources via Context7/WebSearch/WebFetch |
| 3 | All sources dated 2025-2026? | Must Pass | Replace outdated sources with current |
| 4 | Has "## Breaking Changes & Migrations" section? | Must Pass | Research version changes, add section |
| 5 | Has "## Security Considerations" section? | Must Pass | Review security docs, add section |
| 6 | Has "## Verification Steps" checklist? | Must Pass | Add verification checklist |
| 7 | Has "## Dependencies & Risks" section? | Must Pass | Analyze dependencies, add section |
| 8 | Has "## Edge Cases" section? | Must Pass | Document empty/error/loading states |
| 9 | Existing codebase grepped for similar patterns? | Must Pass | Run Grep/SemanticSearch, document findings |
| 10 | Scope matches user request (no unrequested features)? | Must Pass | Remove unrequested features, flag as future work |
| 11 | Verification Steps include 2+ specific acceptance criteria? | Must Pass | Add feature-specific behavioral tests |
| 12 | **If social platform feature**: Competitor feasibility checked? | Conditional | Read `docs/competitor-analysis/buffer-features-feasibility-2026.md`, add findings |

**Validation Gate Logic**:
```
IF any criterion fails:
  STOP finalizing plan
  RUN missing research
  UPDATE plan
  RE-RUN validation
UNTIL all criteria pass
THEN finalize plan
```

