## MANDATORY Plan Template

**Every plan MUST follow this exact structure**:

```markdown
---
name: [plan-name]
overview: [brief description]
todos:
  - id: [task-id]
    content: [task description]
    status: pending
---

# [Plan Title]

## Overview
[Brief description of what the plan accomplishes]

---

## Research Summary

**[Library Name] v[version]**:
- [API/pattern]: [description]
- Source: [URL] ([date, 2025-2026])

---

## Implementation Approach

[Step-by-step approach based on researched patterns]

---

## File Changes

| File | Change | API/Pattern Used | Source |
|---|-----|---|-----|
| `path/to/file.ts` | [description] | [API] from [library] v[version] | [source URL] |

---

## Verification Steps

- [ ] `pnpm run typecheck` (0 errors)
- [ ] `pnpm run lint` (0 warnings)
- [ ] `pnpm run build` (success)
- [ ] [Specific acceptance criterion 1 — user-visible behavior]
- [ ] [Specific acceptance criterion 2 — user-visible behavior]
- [ ] [Specific acceptance criterion 3 — error/edge case behavior]

> **Requirement**: At least 2 verification steps MUST be specific behavioral tests tied to the feature's user value. Generic checks (typecheck/lint/build) do not count toward this minimum.

---

